<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Fralex, Fraser Alexander in talks.</title>
<headline>Fralex, Fraser Alexander in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Alexander Ltd and parent Fralex Ltd said on Monday they were in talks which could have an impact on their share prices and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>They gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
